    {
      "path": "/summary",
      "value": "Business Analyst with 5+ years of experience supporting banking transformation, operational readiness, stakeholder management, requirements analysis, testing coordination, and change initiatives across global banking environments. Worked on various applications such as Hong Kong Workflow System, Global Workflow Instruction System and MyWorkSpace. My main responsibilities include Requirements Engineering (Gathering, Documenting, Analyzing & Presenting). Worked effectively with business stakeholders to gather requirements from them. Played a crucial role by jotting down requirements and explaining them to the Technical/Project Stakeholders. Have worked on both Waterfall & Agile methodologies. Worked in domains like Banking and Insurance for Hongkong and Malaysia clients. Created various documents like BRD, FRD, user stories, acceptance criteria & RTM from the gathered requirements. Involved and played a crucial role in all the scrum ceremonies like Sprint planning, review and retrospective meetings, also worked well with Product Owner in backlog grooming sessions. Analyzed requirements by conducting Moscow, SMART, GAP, SWOT & Root Cause Analysis. Worked on understanding the Business Process and presenting them using Process flow diagrams. Worked on tools like JIRA, MSOFFICE, draw.io, MS Visio. Handled various Change Requests (CRs) effectively by conducting impact analysis.",
