    {
      "path": "/projects/0/description",
      "value": "Manual processing of Fixed Deposit instructions led to delays, errors, and reduced efficiency for branch and operations teams. To overcome this, HWS was developed as a centralized application for staff to create, validate, and manage Fixed Deposits online. The system supported FD creation with deposit amount entry, tenure selection, rate assignment, and debit account verification. Automated validations, real-time status updates, and exception alerts were introduced to reduce errors and improve accuracy. User-friendly screens for new deposits, renewals, and closures enhanced staff productivity. Seamless integration with core banking systems enabled faster and more reliable transaction processing. Standardized workflows ensured consistency across teams and strengthened audit readiness. Overall, the solution accelerated processing, minimized errors, boosted staff efficiency, and delivered a smoother customer experience.",
