    {
      "path": "/projects/1/description",
      "value": "Manual processing of Fixed Deposit and investment instructions across regions led to delays, data entry errors, and compliance risks. To resolve this, GWIS was implemented as a centralized workflow system to capture, validate, and route customer instructions seamlessly. Standardized input screens were designed to ensure uniform data capture of amount, tenure, rate, and debit account details across geographies. Automated validations reduced manual errors and strengthened compliance with regulatory requirements. Approval workflows with multi-level authorization, validations, and exception handling were documented and streamlined. MIS and dashboard reporting within GWIS were introduced to track instruction status, turnaround time, and compliance. This improved visibility, accountability, and operational efficiency across regions. Overall, the project reduced turnaround time by 40%, improved accuracy, enhanced audit trails, and delivered a better customer experience.",
