    {
      "path": "/projects/2/description",
      "value": "Manual tracking of customer transactions across multiple legacy systems created inefficiencies, delays, and limited visibility for commercial and global banking clients. To address this, MWS was implemented as a replacement web application for the online banking system, providing a unified platform to view and manage customer transactions. The application enabled secure access for operations teams to check balances, payment status, and transaction history in real time. It offered intuitive dashboards and search functionality to quickly retrieve customer data across regions. Automated validations and exception alerts reduced manual errors and improved accuracy. Seamless integration with core banking systems ensured faster, more reliable transaction updates. Standardized workflows improved consistency across teams and enhanced audit readiness. Overall, MWS improved efficiency, strengthened data accuracy, and delivered a better experience for both staff and customers.",
